        <detaileddescription>
<para>Saves a single measurement to the disk in cu3 format. The file name is given by the measurement&apos;s name (see <ref refid="group__cuvis__mesu_1ga0082b7bd0bdf5174a6a74dd14e13b3b1" kindref="member">cuvis_measurement_set_name</ref>)</para>
