        </param>
        <briefdescription>
<para>Set the name of the measurement in memory. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>By default, a newly aquired measurement has the name &lt;SESSIONNAME&gt;_&lt;session_no&gt;_&lt;sequence_no&gt; (see <ref refid="cuvis_8h_1a37b4a4195807325caa76d7d24f0d3ccb" kindref="member">CUVIS_SESSION_INFO</ref>). This will also be the name of the file while saving it. This can be changed by this function.</para>
